    <section id="faq" class="container">
        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
        <div class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFAQ(this)">
                <span>How much does trip planning cost?</span>
                <span>+</span>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-answer">
                <p>I offer flexible pricing: $75-150 for a consultation/custom itinerary, or 5-10% commission if I handle bookings. For a full trip coordination, we can work out custom pricing. Your first consultation is just a conversation—no pressure, no hidden fees.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFAQ(this)">
                <span>How far in advance do I need to book?</span>
                <span>+</span>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-answer">
                <p>Ideally 2-3 months for international trips to get the best flight deals. But I also do quick turnarounds—last-minute trips are possible with a rush fee. Even 2 weeks out, I can build something solid.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFAQ(this)">
                <span>What's your budget range?</span>
                <span>+</span>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-answer">
                <p>I specialize in budget-smart travel. Most trips I plan fall in the $800-2,000 range per person, but I can work with less or more. The sweet spot is under $1,500 for a solid international trip with flights, hotels, and activities included.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFAQ(this)">
                <span>Can you plan trips for groups?</span>
                <span>+</span>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-answer">
                <p>Absolutely. I specialize in group trips. The more people, the better deals I can negotiate. Contact me for group pricing and coordination.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFAQ(this)">
                <span>How do you handle bookings?</span>
                <span>+</span>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-answer">
                <p>I find the best flights, hotels, and activities and send you links to book yourself, or I can handle the bookings directly. You're always in control. All reservations are in your name, so you own the bookings completely.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

